# 105_df_sas_armor.rpl — SASQUATCH'S DARK FORCE ARMOR (the +0x161 accumulator),
# measured 14z-123 (tests/audit_df_accumulator.sh). Prologue = replay 97's;
# the pair is chosen by POKES (P1 $FF8782 = 0x0A Sasquatch, P2 $FF8B82 = 0x03
# Victor, both human; P1 $FF8509 = 3 stocks at f3100/3120 for the DF legs).
#
# P1 activates Dark Force with LP+LK at f3260 (the LP+LK / MP+MK activation
# takes the ARMED sub-state; HP+HK takes the un-armed one — the audit's
# second leg swaps this line to p1=36). P2 walks in and lands CROUCHING
# normals only — a crouching button can never throw, and Victor's close
# standing LP with L held is a throw (the 14z-123 first rig lost most of its
# contacts to it). One button every 45 frames, L/M/H cycling.
